\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Now thank we all our God,
\par With hearts, and hands, and voices;
\par Who wondrous things hath done, 
\par In whom His world rejoices;
\par Who, from our mothers' arms,
\par Hath blesses us on our way 
\par With countless gifts of love,
\par And still is ours to-day.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. O may bounteous God 
\par Through all our life be near us,
\par With ever-joyful hearts
\par And blessed peace to cheer us,
\par And keep us in His grace,
\par And guide us when perplexed
\par And free us from all ills
\par In this world and the next.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. All praise and thanks to God 
\par The Father now be given,
\par The Son, and Him who reigns
\par With Them in highest heaven :
\par The one, eternal God
\par Whom earth and heaven adore;
\par For thus it was, is now,
\par And shall be evermore.    Amen.
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

